  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.55,
      "end": 3.3049999999999997,
      "text": "At one point, BlackBerry was one of the most powerful"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.385,
      "end": 7.336,
      "text": "names in smartphones. So how did it lose its place in the market?"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.433,
      "end": 11.283,
      "text": "BlackBerry built its reputation on secure messaging,"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.5,
      "end": 14.015,
      "text": "physical keyboards, and business communication."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.22,
      "end": 18.702,
      "text": "By 2009, it held almost 20 percent of the global smartphone market."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.421,
      "end": 20.843,
      "text": "Then the market changed."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.0,
      "end": 24.149,
      "text": "Apple's iPhone introduced a new kind of smartphone experience,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.35,
      "end": 27.12,
      "text": "while Android brought touchscreen devices to a growing range"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.2,
      "end": 34.04,
      "text": "of manufacturers. BlackBerry struggled to respond quickly enough."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.12,
      "end": 37.469,
      "text": "It underestimated how much consumers valued large touchscreens,"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.67,
      "end": 40.941,
      "text": "broader app ecosystems, and a different mobile experience."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.41,
      "end": 45.498,
      "text": "The consequences were enormous."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.64,
      "end": 48.85,
      "text": "BlackBerry's global smartphone unit market share fell from around 20"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.93,
      "end": 53.066,
      "text": "percent in 2009 to almost nothing by 2016."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.433,
      "end": 60.050000000000004,
      "text": "BlackBerry eventually stopped developing its own phone hardware and shifted"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.13,
      "end": 62.787,
      "text": "its focus toward software, cybersecurity,"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.0,
      "end": 66.124,
      "text": "and secure communications. The company didn't disappear."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.3,
      "end": 66.985,
      "text": "It changed what it"
    },
    {
      "start": 67.065,
      "end": 71.887,
      "text": "was. Here's the lesson: your biggest advantage today can become"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.967,
      "end": 73.45,
      "text": "your biggest weakness tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.64,
      "end": 76.415,
      "text": "Success requires more than protecting what works."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.57,
      "end": 79.556,
      "text": "It requires adapting before the market leaves you behind."
    }
  ]
}
